[Term]
id: OKRA:0000057
name: Leaf hopper damage rating trait
namespace: OKRA  
is_a: OKRA:0000002 ! Morhological

[Term]
id: OKRA:0000066
name: Leaf hopper damage rating - Categorical (0-5)
namespace: OKRA
def: "Rating of the two-spotted cotton leafhopper (jassid) based on a 6-point categorical scale from 0-5; where 0=no damage, entire leaf is green; 1=low damage, where 1-25% of the leaf shows hopperburn, yellowing at margins; 2=Medium damage, 26-50% of leaf area showing hopperburn, slight cupping at margins; 3=High damage, where 51-75% of the leaf area shows hopperburn, severe cupping and bronzing; 4=Severe damage, where entire leaf area showing hopperburn, petiole and leaf dried; 5=Complete damage, entire leaf is dried." []
relationship: variable_of OKRA:0000057 ! Leaf hopper damage rating trait

